# NASA NeoWs API — exploratory requests
# Uses DEMO_KEY (rate limited: 30 req/hour, 50 req/day)
# Replace with your own key from https://api.nasa.gov/

### Feed for current week (Oct 27 – Nov 2, 2026)
GET https://api.nasa.gov/neo/rest/v1/feed?start_date=2026-10-27&end_date=2026-11-02&api_key=DEMO_KEY

